WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.975
Section 3.

00:00:01.925 --> 00:00:03.850
Richard Colvin.

00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:15.550
When a Canadian diplomat reported that Afghan detainees were being transferred to face torture, his government attacked his character and threatened him with prosecution under the Security of Information Act.
